sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR/Manager"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.holidays.create)"
    participant Controller as "Admin HolidayController"
    participant Model as "Holiday Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form lalu klik Simpan
    View->>Controller: POST /admin/holidays
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi nama, tanggal, keterangan, is_national
    Controller->>Model: Holiday::create(validated)
    Model->>DB: INSERT holidays
    DB-->>Model: Data libur tersimpan
    Model-->>Controller: Holiday berhasil dibuat

    alt Data valid (field wajib valid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi libur berhasil ditambahkan
    else Data tidak valid (validasi gagal / tanggal tidak valid)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal menambah libur
    end
